reaction "乙醇氧化为乙醛"
equation "CH₃CH₂OH + [O] → CH₃CHO + H₂O"
summary "伯醇在适当氧化条件下先氧化为醛，继续氧化可得到羧酸。"

step "乙醇结构" {
  note "伯醇的羟基碳上至少有一个氢，能够氧化为醛。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom O4 O radical
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H3a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O3 H3a 1
}

step "脱氢并形成羰基" {
  note "羟基碳失去氢，O-H上的氢也参与形成水，C=O形成。考试重点：伯醇→醛→羧酸；仲醇→酮。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom O4 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H4a H
  atom H4b H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 2
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond O4 H4a 1
  bond O4 H4b 1
}
